<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" ?>
<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.1//EN" "http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml11/DTD/xhtml11.dtd">
<html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xml:lang="ko"><head><title>[GridView] 병합된 헤더 컬럼에 정렬 기능을 사용할 바디 컬럼 지정하기</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="css/book.css" type="text/css" /><meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="application/xhtml+xml; charset=utf-8" /><meta name="EPB-UUID" content="f1fbcef72ff0a2ec" /></head><body><div class="chapter_content"><h1 id="r_5a1312eb98632c12" class="chapter_title">[GridView] 병합된 헤더 컬럼에 정렬 기능을 사용할 바디 컬럼 지정하기</h1><h1 id="r_80670f64ca40e776" class="element heading1" data-element-id="80670f64ca40e776"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading1_n">1</span><span>개요</span></div></h1><pre id="r_7949e141767588fc" class="element pre" data-element-id="7949e141767588fc">GridView의 헤더 컬럼이 병합되었을 때 정렬 기능을 적용할 바디 컬럼을 지정하는 예제입니다. 이 기능은 GridView의 'sortable' 속성과 헤더 컬럼의 'orderByColumn' 속성을 사용하여 구현할 수 있습니다.</pre><p id="r_f76e72e5aba90357" class="element r_example_link_p" data-element-id="f76e72e5aba90357"><a class="link" href="http://example.websquare.kr/link.html?p=P00119">P00119</a></p><h1 id="r_411656a422d107a6" class="element heading1" data-element-id="411656a422d107a6"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading1_n">2</span><span>구현된 기능</span></div></h1><ul id="r_98cd3374dd811d52" class="element unordered_list" data-element-id="98cd3374dd811d52"><li><p>헤더 컬럼에 정렬 기능을 적용할 바디 컬럼 지정하기</p></li><li><p>(기본 설정) 정렬 기준 미지정</p></li></ul><h1 id="r_3e6e539eb611f40e" class="element heading1" data-element-id="3e6e539eb611f40e"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading1_n">3</span><span>예제 테스트 방법</span></div></h1><h2 id="r_f5e3ffa7e2b7cbcd" class="element heading2" data-element-id="f5e3ffa7e2b7cbcd"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading2_n">3.1</span><span>병합된 헤더 컬럼의 정렬 기능을 세 번째 바디 컬럼에 지정하기</span></div></h2><pre id="r_32db884757c6807b" class="element pre" data-element-id="32db884757c6807b">예제 영역 '<span class="r_th_title_1_span">세 번째 바디 컬럼이 정렬</span>'에 구성된 GridView에서 테스트합니다.</pre><div id="r_81d23ed4cdbb3d12" class="element step1" data-element-id="81d23ed4cdbb3d12"><p class="step1_n">1</p><p>STPE 1: 헤더 컬럼의 정렬 기능 아이콘을 클릭합니다.</p></div><div id="r_4f9183a84454225b" class="element image step1_indent" data-element-id="4f9183a84454225b"><p class="caption"><span class="image_caption_n">Image 1.</span>브라우저(Chrome) 실행 예시</p><p class="content"><img alt="" src="images/image663.png" width="371" height="195" /></p></div><div id="r_4bfd62a4c6183372" class="element step1" data-element-id="4bfd62a4c6183372"><p class="step1_n">2</p><p>STEP 2: 실행된 결과를 확인합니다.</p></div><p id="r_2ea633cf86a3ab83" class="element normal step1_indent" data-element-id="2ea633cf86a3ab83">정렬 기능이 병합된 헤더 컬럼의 세 번째 바디 컬럼에 적용되어 동작합니다.</p><p id="r_88087e1ec3903b55" class="element normal step1_indent" data-element-id="88087e1ec3903b55">세 번째 컬럼이 오름 차순으로 정렬됩니다.</p><div id="r_d894d4c85e419db1" class="element image step1_indent" data-element-id="d894d4c85e419db1"><p class="caption"><span class="image_caption_n">Image 2.</span>브라우저(Chrome) 실행 예시</p><p class="content"><img alt="" src="images/image664.png" width="370" height="195" /></p></div><h2 id="r_3653b5e7dbe9969f" class="element heading2" data-element-id="3653b5e7dbe9969f"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading2_n">3.2</span><span>(기본 설정) 정렬 기준 미지정</span></div></h2><pre id="r_793a6a9f342ea2ae" class="element pre" data-element-id="793a6a9f342ea2ae">예제 영역 '<span class="r_th_title_1_span">(기본 설정) 정렬 기준 미지정</span>'에 구성된 GridView에서 테스트합니다.</pre><div id="r_ce1495c66150f9d8" class="element step1" data-element-id="ce1495c66150f9d8"><p class="step1_n">1</p><p>STPE 1: 헤더 컬럼의 정렬 기능 아이콘을 클릭합니다.</p></div><div id="r_39c950b1dd588cbd" class="element image step1_indent" data-element-id="39c950b1dd588cbd"><p class="caption"><span class="image_caption_n">Image 3.</span>브라우저(Chrome) 실행 예시</p><p class="content"><img alt="" src="images/image665.png" width="371" height="195" /></p></div><div id="r_12720d8a1181c016" class="element step1" data-element-id="12720d8a1181c016"><p class="step1_n">2</p><p>STEP 2: 실행된 결과를 확인합니다.</p></div><p id="r_1a03b23888f55be6" class="element normal step1_indent" data-element-id="1a03b23888f55be6">정렬 기능이 병합된 헤더 컬럼의 첫 번째 바디 컬럼에 적용되어 동작합니다.</p><p id="r_f3f565909ee0026c" class="element normal step1_indent" data-element-id="f3f565909ee0026c">첫 번째 바디 컬럼이 오름 차순으로 정렬됩니다.</p><div id="r_ffb56c0330dc7677" class="element image step1_indent" data-element-id="ffb56c0330dc7677"><p class="caption"><span class="image_caption_n">Image 4.</span>브라우저(Chrome) 실행 예시</p><p class="content"><img alt="" src="images/image666.png" width="369" height="193" /></p></div><h1 id="r_1a92f474f03f5729" class="element heading1" data-element-id="1a92f474f03f5729"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading1_n">4</span><span>구현 예시</span></div></h1><h2 id="r_48cc401063d1daf7" class="element heading2" data-element-id="48cc401063d1daf7"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading2_n">4.1</span><span>병합된 헤더 컬럼의 정렬 기능을 특정 바디 컬럼에 지정하기</span></div></h2><div id="r_448a4e7e7ba52fc2" class="element step1" data-element-id="448a4e7e7ba52fc2"><p class="step1_n">1</p><p>STEP 1: GridView의 속성을 정의합니다.</p></div><ul id="r_86c461dddd71fedd" class="element unordered_list step1_indent" data-element-id="86c461dddd71fedd"><li><p><span class="r_blue001_span">[필수] sortable="true"</span> </p><p>gridView의 헤더 클릭을 통한 데이터 정렬 지원 여부</p></li><li><p><em>[선택] showSortableImage="true"</em> </p><p>정렬 가능한 컬럼의 헤더에 정렬 이미지를 출력.</p></li><li><p><em>[선택] sortEvent="onclick"</em> </p><p>[default: ondblclick, onclick] 정렬을 수행할 이벤트를 정의.</p></li></ul><div id="r_e8bc5462acb67246" class="element image step1_indent" data-element-id="e8bc5462acb67246"><p class="caption"><span class="image_caption_n">Image 5.</span>웹스퀘어 스튜디오의 Component View - 속성 설정 예시</p><p class="content"><img alt="" src="images/image667.png" width="316" height="185" /></p></div><div id="r_44ac2ac563a7d683" class="element step1" data-element-id="44ac2ac563a7d683"><p class="step1_n">2</p><p>STEP 2: GridView의 헤더 컬럼의 속성을 정의합니다.</p></div><ul id="r_eb0be1a33cd6cd87" class="element unordered_list step1_indent" data-element-id="eb0be1a33cd6cd87"><li><p><span class="r_blue001_span">[필수] orderByColumn="바디 컬럼 ID"</span> </p><p>정렬 기능을 적용할 바디 컬럼의 ID</p><p>예시) orderByColumn="stock"</p></li></ul><div id="r_6ba2d1aa3944fd9c" class="element image step1_indent" data-element-id="6ba2d1aa3944fd9c"><p class="caption"><span class="image_caption_n">Image 6.</span>웹스퀘어 스튜디오의 Component View - 헤더 컬럼 속성 설정 예시</p><p class="content"><img alt="" src="images/image668.png" width="252" height="159" /></p></div><div id="r_ba3168595d71d52a" class="element code support_code_numbering step1_indent" data-element-id="ba3168595d71d52a"><p class="caption"><span class="code_caption_n">Example 1.</span>Source</p><pre><span class="digits_10 code_line"></span><span class="r_h_comment_span">&lt;!-- gridView 의 소스 본문 예시 --&gt;</span>
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&lt;w2:gridView <span class="r_h_attribute_name_span">sortable</span>=<span class="r_h_attribute_value_span">"true"</span> <span class="r_h_attribute_name_span">sortEvent</span>=<span class="r_h_attribute_value_span">"onclick"</span> <span class="r_h_attribute_name_span">showSortableImage</span>=<span class="r_h_attribute_value_span">"true"</span> <span class="r_h_attribute_name_span">dataList</span>=<span class="r_h_attribute_value_span">"data:dlt_exam_1"</span>&gt;
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="r_h_comment_span">&lt;!-- 중략 --&gt;</span>
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&lt;w2:header <span class="r_h_attribute_name_span">id</span>=<span class="r_h_attribute_value_span">"header1"</span>&gt;
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&lt;w2:row <span class="r_h_attribute_name_span">id</span>=<span class="r_h_attribute_value_span">"row1"</span>&gt;
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&lt;w2:column <span class="r_h_attribute_name_span">orderByColumn</span>=<span class="r_h_attribute_value_span">"stock"</span> <span class="r_h_attribute_name_span">value</span>=<span class="r_h_attribute_value_span">"Product Info"</span> <span class="r_h_attribute_name_span">colSpan</span>=<span class="r_h_attribute_value_span">"3"</span>&gt;&lt;/w2:column&gt;
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="r_h_comment_span">&lt;!-- 중략 --&gt;</span>
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&lt;/w2:row&gt;
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&lt;/w2:header&gt;
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&lt;w2:gBody <span class="r_h_attribute_name_span">id</span>=<span class="r_h_attribute_value_span">"gBody1"</span>&gt;
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&lt;w2:row <span class="r_h_attribute_name_span">id</span>=<span class="r_h_attribute_value_span">"row2"</span>&gt;
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="r_h_comment_span">&lt;!-- 중략 --&gt;</span>
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&lt;w2:column <span class="r_h_attribute_name_span">id</span>=<span class="r_h_attribute_value_span">"stock"</span> <span class="r_h_attribute_name_span">dataType</span>=<span class="r_h_attribute_value_span">"number"</span> <span class="r_h_attribute_name_span">displayFormat</span>=<span class="r_h_attribute_value_span">"#,###"</span>&gt;&lt;/w2:column&gt;
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="r_h_comment_span">&lt;!-- 중략 --&gt;</span>
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&lt;/w2:row&gt;
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&lt;/w2:gBody&gt;
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&lt;/w2:gridView&gt;</pre></div><h1 id="r_5d797cef3bc45092" class="element heading1" data-element-id="5d797cef3bc45092"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading1_n">5</span><span>주요 API</span></div></h1><ul id="r_4ce14c20d271ef15" class="element unordered_list" data-element-id="4ce14c20d271ef15"><li><p><span class="r_ex_api_property_span">[header column] orderByColumn</span></p></li><li><p><span class="r_ex_api_property_span">sortable</span></p></li><li><p><span class="r_ex_api_property_span">showSortableImage</span></p></li><li><p><span class="r_ex_api_property_span">sortEvent</span></p></li></ul></div></body></html>